WEBVTT

00:22:58.412 --> 00:23:00.920
Lyn was creative in where
she looked for her mentors.

00:23:00.944 --> 00:23:04.447
LS: I found out
that I could get a press pass

00:23:04.471 --> 00:23:07.812
to what is called the market shows,

00:23:07.836 --> 00:23:13.574
and I would spend hours talking
with these young designers.

00:23:13.598 --> 00:23:18.599
They taught me a great deal
about how clothing is made,

00:23:18.623 --> 00:23:20.749
what the processes are.

00:23:20.773 --> 00:23:26.406
That's how I really began
to understand fashion.

00:23:27.205 --> 00:23:29.582
AG: Instead of being intimidated
by new technology

00:23:29.606 --> 00:23:32.240
and seeing it as something
only young people can master,